<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Yabeng cautions again on sale of stake.</title>
<headline>Yabeng cautions again on sale of stake.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yabeng Investment Holding Co Ltd said on Thursday that the intended disposal by North West Development Corp Ltd of its shareholding in Yabeng by public tender was still in process.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
